{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_02_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a24b52524d6594581f53c25da686c0fe01e29e83f170f3e91c4b6719c8e4cb9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1568b7b7dac24c42b8cd8640d33176a43aede70e8b0710cf236df367c2cc29d",
      "text": "距离玩具大会还有一个月……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c2658ce3b317dc49130d32c3225de6e50722e8e28022df99a40fc68e4c38d2",
      "text": "这个绕法、这个角度，完美。\n贝独乐的必胜法……让你们见识一下！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a21ee5dbe0470ac2cfcea13e2227300e74818f235d3a1941246e08b16120b3",
      "text": "……预备！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74fd222c056f74ba2230b23ad411d815e1adc9b1e4b419abf4eb6cf2821f2a49",
      "text": "是我赢了呢。\n怎么了一年级学生会长，刚才那个就是必胜法吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed8c1e60e577f3b70c44042e5fbdcc380f14336e58b07d26bbc2cbc515b50f1",
      "text": "……道夫先生，打扰一下。关于绕绳的方法，\n我还想再多请教一下……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d3d8ee2b3f91d98808d88997475c5deacf50d0ffcad46b5f7bac6f96c7a36c",
      "text": "嗯。不行，天峰君。已经这个时间了。\n先把玩具收拾好，稍微休息一下。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb2498994416ef15e1f2eb9cceff5453f719058b16b2b04ad3288f9aa27823c",
      "text": "……好～的……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae29bcb9d4b39fa2395ce9193dd2942138267749676be609bf6ae9ce426ecaf",
      "text": "道夫先生，这次真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fadcd4269787421b2ae1a7f0fd8244a51321d0ea59cfaafe9da6e5f2d6f25d0",
      "text": "没想到S.E.M的各位居然会\n来协助特训玩具玩法。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd5ac3fc341a98e6bf601a4ad7ca50a1b6a6a748a9f374d00f68fd910256cfe6",
      "text": "没关系。在教导学业的同时，也教导如何玩耍。\n这也是我们大人的义务吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7165c2376fe1ef3a6fede2ad04325c641adb1a97b9ae38d06139db2b7c63af2a",
      "text": "而且……我自己，\n也感到非常怀念呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15be3bf24efd69969913a11ff17d64d45bdd2dbc95d28d004e11b34716a32163",
      "text": "啊……请看。不仅道夫先生，\n类先生和次郎先生看起来也玩得非常开心呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc82c7af7d7eccd488723848d255dc1aed33efa1824afe2c51b09a22943e0c36",
      "text": "Oh no！Mr. 山下，再来一局！\n就再来一次……对啦，接下来用剑玉决胜负吧☆",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998015ff5f732325ff605b9bd177c718f458132b44f36ff318eb09a27074c194",
      "text": "哎～，怎么办好呢～？\n那下次输的人可要请客吃烤肉哦～？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_f:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:746f5f0219b742062f59d63fd90e3e00a765522ad290a46294de826f62f4e665",
      "text": "……咳咳。我也，有那么沉浸在\n童心里吗……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
